   "lines": [
    "Walked down to",
    "Island Falls, through",
    "the woods — about 25",
    "miles. The walking",
    "was pretty ^good^, the",
    "scenery beautiful",
    "— for besides the",
    "forests, grand enough",
    "in themselves, we",
    "passed several water-",
    "-falls in deep ravines —",
    "and I shot several",
    "partridges. Wore one",
    "of my moccasins almost",
    "out, which made me",
    "rather footsore."
   ],
